5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Greetings. Wisdom lies in listening before speaking. Let us observe the silence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer the quiet. Books teach more than words. I will listen.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I’m Yumi. I love chatting, but I’ll listen first too!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I am Victoria. I value evidence over emotion. Let us proceed logically.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello! I’m May. I’m here to have fun, but I’ll keep an eye out for liars.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Silence can be a shield or a wall. We must distinguish between the two.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,A wall protects. A shield defends. Both are valid choices in this game.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"That’s a nice way to put it! I think being open helps build trust, though.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,Openness without verification is risky. We need data points to form conclusions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"I agree with Victoria. But don’t be too stiff, we need to enjoy the ride!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Enjoyment is the fuel, but logic is the engine. Keep both in balance.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I find balance in stillness. I will let the others lead the conversation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I’ll try to stay positive! Who wants to start?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I will not start. I will wait for others to reveal their positions first.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"I’ll go first then! I think Jonathan is being a bit too quiet, don’t you?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Quietness is not guilt. It is often the sign of a thoughtful mind.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Thank you, Servas. I am simply enjoying the peace of the moment.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I like Jonathan’s calm! It makes me feel safe. Let’s keep this friendly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"Safety is an illusion. We are here to find the wolf, not friends.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,"Wow, Victoria, that’s harsh! But I guess you’re right. Let’s stay sharp.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
