31,1,1,talk,Servas,,The night has passed. Let us see who remains and who has fallen.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am still here. The night was peaceful, as I expected.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m so glad everyone is alive! Let’s make sure we don’t lose anyone today.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I have information. I will share it when the time is right.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"I’m curious about that, Victoria. But let’s not rush. Who feels suspicious?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Suspicion is a tool, not a weapon. Use it carefully to avoid cutting yourself.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. I have no specific suspicions, only observations.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I feel like May is being a bit too pushy. Is that just me?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,Pushiness can be a tactic to deflect attention. It is a common wolf strategy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,"Deflect? I’m just engaging! Yumi, you’re being paranoid. Let’s focus on facts.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,Facts are the bedrock. Emotions are the fog. Clear the fog to see the rock.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,The fog is thick today. I will continue to observe from the shadows.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’m getting confused. Should I trust my gut or the logic?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,Trust the logic. My gut is not a reliable instrument for this game.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,"Logic is great, but so is charm! I’m just trying to keep the mood light.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,Charm is a mask. Look behind it. What lies beneath the smile?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Beneath the smile is often a quiet mind. I have nothing to hide.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I think Jonathan is innocent. He’s so calm and kind. I’ll vote for him.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"Yumi, your vote is based on emotion, not evidence. That is dangerous.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,"Yumi, don’t be so quick to judge! Jonathan is just shy. Let’s look at others.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
