64,2,1,talk,Servas,,Jonathan is gone. The silence he left is heavy. We must be more precise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! I’m so sorry, Jonathan. I feel terrible for voting for him.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Victoria,,Your regret is noted. It does not change the outcome. We must move forward.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,May,,"Yumi, it’s okay. We all make mistakes. Let’s focus on finding the real wolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Mistakes are teachers. Learn from them, but do not let them paralyze you.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Yumi,,I’m shaking. I just want to do the right thing. Who do you think is the wolf?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Victoria,,I have divined two players. Both are human. The wolf is among the rest.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,May,,"That’s helpful! So it’s either me, Servas, or you, Victoria. Let’s discuss.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If Victoria is the Seer, her information is valuable. We should protect her.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I trust Victoria! She’s so smart and logical. I’ll vote for May instead.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"Yumi, your trust is misplaced. I am not here to be protected, but to win.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,May,,"Wow, Victoria, that’s cold. I’m just trying to help. Why are you so aggressive?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Servas,,Aggression is a sign of fear. The wolf fears being exposed. Observe closely.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I’m scared too, but I’ll try to stay calm. I think May is the wolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"If May is the wolf, she will try to turn the vote against me. Watch her.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,May,,"I’m not the wolf! I’m just passionate. Let’s vote for Victoria, she’s too suspicious.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
